    <section class="founder-note">
      <div class="kicker">A note from the founder</div>
      <div class="founder-note__body">
        <p>Commercial real estate is one of the biggest decisions a business makes.</p>

        <p>Yet the process often begins by scrolling through thousands of listings.</p>

        <p><strong>I believe that's backwards.</strong></p>

        <p>The most important decision usually isn't which building to lease. It's deciding <strong>where your business should be</strong>.</p>

        <p>That decision is influenced by far more than available space. It depends on your customers, your employees, your budget, your timeline, and the unique characteristics of every market and neighborhood.</p>

        <p>After more than twenty years helping businesses evaluate commercial real estate, I kept seeing the same challenge. Companies were spending enormous amounts of time comparing properties before they had confidence they were searching in the right market.</p>

        <p>Rofo was created to change that.</p>

        <p>Rather than treating commercial real estate as a collection of listings, we're building a commercial location intelligence platform that helps businesses make better location decisions before they begin searching for space.</p>

        <p>Behind Rofo is connected commercial location knowledge that relates markets, districts, neighborhoods, representative buildings, and millions of commercial properties. It's the foundation that allows us to deliver recommendations built around fit instead of simply displaying inventory.</p>

        <p><strong>Technology, however, isn't the goal.</strong></p>

        <p>The goal is helping businesses make one of their biggest decisions with greater confidence.</p>

        <p>We're still building toward that vision. Every recommendation, every market guide, and every product improvement brings us closer to making commercial location decisions simpler, smarter, and more transparent.</p>

        <p>Thank you for visiting Rofo. I appreciate you spending time with us, and I hope Rofo helps you find the right location for your business.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="founder-note__signature">
        <strong>Alan Bernier</strong>
        <span>Founder &amp; CEO, Rofo</span>
      </div>
    </section>

